            <div xml:id="m-8c94d9ca-8b36-42de-81b1-362916f34dfb">
              <lg xml:id="m-2b11b0dd-2199-4543-87cc-9f1390521083">
                <l xml:id="m-94f1549f-4d50-45ce-804c-c636f6f12089" facs="#m-b70a8453-dffa-44c6-bd44-3801ec77832f" label="text-like">The readings or lessons</l><l xml:id="m-98644397-0155-4e4b-a8b5-d7b44b074cc9" facs="#m-518fbb46-eab9-4a3d-b553-851ba3dd10e3" label="ambiguous">776s</l><l xml:id="m-b45aa4d2-cf6a-449b-811c-ae93b5eb85e0" facs="#m-e4fefc88-c0a6-465e-9c8c-56f261fce485" label="lyrics-like">V. Dó-minus cónte-rens bél¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5911988-93de-40df-82e5-43320a13a4bb" facs="#m-df4d93b9-3f51-4994-8763-bdd4b06c14e8" label="ambiguous">la:</l><l xml:id="m-20b08fa7-b5b9-42a4-a9af-1ba618a05b81" facs="#m-790edca3-240b-40e2-82bc-10cebbb8b545" label="ambiguous">um.</l><l xml:id="m-21a58923-7d7c-46d9-bb09-6134c47b8e81" facs="#m-0b11891e-d885-4789-bc58-6cbdb6b39de5" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi-nus“ nómen est fl-li.</l><l xml:id="m-7cfa2931-2579-44d4-84b6-688424fbe9a4" facs="#m-162ca3e5-ab3b-4873-9022-e70648ecf3e3" label="lyrics-like">Orémus. D. Flectámus génua. D. Leváte.</l><l xml:id="m-fc6a8817-64d4-4fba-862b-0d5d7c6584cf" facs="#m-2b499d87-c18a-42ea-b96e-b2e2cbc9458a" label="text-like">Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-96111827-f1a6-43ff-a695-388ef495a864" facs="#m-e1789ed2-7e16-4cc7-a86b-fb88710c695c" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cujus antíqua mirácula! géntium per aquam regenera¬</l><l xml:id="m-56a30e69-c4a4-42b1-b836-d462d82a4ba9" facs="#m-a4a529cb-0f78-4725-af3a-a264b0148b74" label="lyrics-like">étiam nostris saéculis co¬</l><l xml:id="m-caaa8c9f-a75d-463c-940c-18318fa37a4e" facs="#m-3ca65bd6-45ee-4fd9-87dd-d752e5c1c00b" label="lyrics-like">tiónis operáris: * praesta; ut</l><l xml:id="m-48938799-979d-43ce-9ef0-ef242c01e3ac" facs="#m-f117da2b-bf86-43fa-9e6d-4ee16a3eeb42" label="lyrics-like">in Abrahae filios, et in Israëli¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d90af2b-2a4b-4802-8b36-0fa4dc439bac" facs="#m-3d8d74a9-6624-4b40-9939-bd96c8133267" label="lyrics-like">ruscáre sentimus: “ dum quod</l><l xml:id="m-ad98e41d-9a0e-4237-9e08-a65324434b1e" facs="#m-c5d7f349-0aa7-44e8-a80b-d336f537f73b" label="lyrics-like">uni pópulo, a persecutióne Ægy¬</l><l xml:id="m-96bd3729-71bf-467a-aaf9-49d85c82efce" facs="#m-3bc7491f-119c-4900-8bcb-7eb03b43fb54" label="lyrics-like">ticam dignitátem, totius mundi</l><l xml:id="m-1ef45e43-bdfa-4bec-a5e4-c30d23f33341" facs="#m-05173e72-590d-440b-8aeb-2681bea10b6c" label="lyrics-like">tránseat plenitúdo. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1cb6399-b020-4943-99cf-040d4ad6723e" facs="#m-0d155f54-53ce-435e-b32f-cf58772826dd" label="lyrics-like">ptíaca liberándo, déxterae tuae</l><l xml:id="m-b9725d75-4a40-4bf5-acea-4b7ce1f41c01" facs="#m-54e19432-2db3-47f2-9df9-c95fdf0b7162" label="lyrics-like">poténtia contulisti, id in salútem! num nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-908c01e8-dcd8-4308-aa42-275f52131fe6" facs="#m-07ac3946-50fb-40df-9224-08d76e93ef6e" label="ambiguous">Is.4, 2-6</l><l xml:id="m-b19b21c4-22a3-48e9-b48c-c7cc24282f8b" facs="#m-591fed5d-52d5-491d-b3df-f2ebea205b35" label="ambiguous">LESSON III</l><l xml:id="m-74a8caed-196d-47e6-a157-c5ecea06f857" facs="#m-cbbf3e37-58b0-4810-9925-cf2e2bbedb3f" label="lyrics-like">judicii, et spíritu ardóris. Et</l><l xml:id="m-3ebe7732-be13-497c-b285-75f61b08211b" facs="#m-5c9a7e79-691a-4ca5-a533-2230c9576f6e" label="lyrics-like">IN die illa erit germen Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-1162113c-93c9-448c-9c70-297a80b20052" facs="#m-69125ea1-e1cd-4122-b944-9a708bb0374b" label="lyrics-like">Ain magnincéntia, et glória,</l><l xml:id="m-5141dcc2-a29a-42e2-ab93-bb2ba874d60d" facs="#m-f6d6832c-78d7-44a3-9ed5-6d815d04dc2d" label="lyrics-like">creábit Dóminus super omnem</l><l xml:id="m-c0256565-faf6-428d-b031-2ce421458ba1" facs="#m-26f38548-17f7-419f-a0fb-7e19f7fb303f" label="ambiguous">locum montis Sion, et ubi invo¬</l><l xml:id="m-42f2476e-d649-4572-a153-df830d580d28" facs="#m-a2947c8c-8825-428b-9c6e-a379441f708a" label="ambiguous">et fructus terrae sublimis, et</l><l xml:id="m-2309e094-eefe-4f58-aeb5-50c8e3bc9226" facs="#m-3921e971-d7a6-48e4-ba79-85a2dc4ad3f1" label="lyrics-like">exsultátio his, qui salváti fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed2b526a-47a4-4a4a-acbd-f408101101a1" facs="#m-900342fa-e61c-495a-aa86-0c4df566eb8f" label="lyrics-like">cátus est, nubem per diem, et</l><l xml:id="m-1ebc272b-2f41-4799-aa7b-abc29680ec82" facs="#m-ec43ebac-e4b1-4eb3-a6cc-82e9eae7c5e7" label="lyrics-like">erint de Israël. Et erit: Omnis</l><l xml:id="m-f1888467-033f-4db8-acde-17d70413a171" facs="#m-9b6b24bb-92f8-464d-b7cd-5b4eda22c8b9" label="lyrics-like">fumum, et splendórem ignis</l><l xml:id="m-6deacff6-1d3e-47e9-b297-7c5d33739556" facs="#m-c9b65935-f5e8-4158-8aff-45f84bb73587" label="lyrics-like">qui relictus fúerit in Sion, et</l><l xml:id="m-30c9f8a4-5eac-4079-af1a-81389fa3f3b4" facs="#m-072b0bcf-08cd-4a8a-910f-5ab163b7a876" label="lyrics-like">flammántis in nocte: super</l><l xml:id="m-4d7e6cff-0d5a-4dca-acfc-077fd5c78c22" facs="#m-614c620d-9904-484d-bb05-e7e859594ef2" label="lyrics-like">resíduus in Jerúsalem, sanctus</l><l xml:id="m-10dfe8cd-e312-4403-8576-7e646a5768b3" facs="#m-b63764da-3d05-4177-863b-e8f4daa2e1e7" label="lyrics-like">omnem enim glóriam protéctio.</l><l xml:id="m-16f0c2a1-9423-4b5f-885c-2fe70da34503" facs="#m-74f6c5fa-654f-4534-8691-156e04a41bcb" label="lyrics-like">Et tabernáculum erit in umbrá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d96bb1af-edbc-4024-90ed-9fd011867327" facs="#m-94caa3c4-92b9-46ac-a705-46d348a652fd" label="lyrics-like">vocábitur, omnis qui scriptus</l><l xml:id="m-b87ad34d-571d-4085-a5a7-087f396ddbbc" facs="#m-0e8d0373-ad57-4552-b5ce-f0424ecceead" label="lyrics-like">culum diéi ab aestu, et in secu¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3f43870-53a5-4f9e-9781-c7b6cdf70a18" facs="#m-a10b1740-3699-45f3-901d-b103d06ab7d8" label="lyrics-like">est in vita in Jerúsalem. Si</l><l xml:id="m-b01ebbc2-d807-468e-9ecc-4c483f9923c7" facs="#m-ea1a3d6d-3826-42d5-85d3-67d630ed1e22" label="lyrics-like">ablúerit Dóminus sordes filiárum</l><l xml:id="m-6eda6229-06fe-41fe-9d33-b6e217bed442" facs="#m-a5146b8b-2abf-43a8-9131-89b90c1514a4" label="lyrics-like">ritátem, et absconsiónem a túr¬</l><l xml:id="m-05cbeee1-9609-4592-bf08-9e63b750e86e" facs="#m-ca1f6d5e-7c57-41fe-92a3-526c44f8508a" label="lyrics-like">Sion, et sánguinem Jerúsalem</l><l xml:id="m-52ca4349-6fdd-468f-9a64-ef35ad90c144" facs="#m-9838e3c6-dc6b-4f57-9159-ef1615296f01" label="lyrics-like">bine, et a plúvia.</l><l xml:id="m-98f1a7c8-babf-4b83-8cc4-d7e6f5c1e4aa" facs="#m-74f8e4b1-3698-4ab1-baf8-58700295e832" label="lyrics-like">láverit de médio ejus, in spiritu</l><l xml:id="m-60a86816-eaab-4361-9e8a-616a1780d490" facs="#m-e1accaaa-c75e-4534-990c-6fed83bd1521" label="ambiguous">Canticle</l><l xml:id="m-89f77479-dd1e-4f2b-83ca-f6c58a538c08" facs="#m-8a38490c-434b-42ed-874b-04a4ffda3bbc" label="text-like">Is.5, 1 and 2</l><l xml:id="m-7ed8da4b-6e57-4b70-98eb-aab0f3bfd9d8" facs="#m-8aca94c6-797e-4c16-b4ad-3f59550cd7a3" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-0f426106-e8be-47cb-b153-afa81c3afd57" facs="#m-13f0a84f-825c-426e-92df-dd2f2793dfd3" label="lyrics-like">"fácta est</l><l xml:id="m-388bd69d-3a9b-49b2-b59c-0892fcc77114" facs="#m-f82e8024-ba37-4279-89f2-98fd6bf8a920" label="lyrics-like">di- lé-cto</l><l xml:id="m-ea10d003-6233-460f-954c-41879eb3b5ae" facs="#m-a6521f1e-42f0-40a9-8757-98aca858112c" label="ambiguous">= Ine¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-cfd929f7-b8ae-4edc-8e57-c8aa0702e058" facs="#m-100e94b8-e37c-443d-a8eb-a872742117ca" label="lyrics-like">V. Et macé¬</l><l xml:id="m-33d27884-3311-4fb8-9777-c2fa5ccb0f96" facs="#m-fef59424-4f19-4ff4-b26d-b70e6e3125ba" label="lyrics-like">in córnu.</l><l xml:id="m-863f5216-b0d1-4651-bcdf-95805672360f" facs="#m-b83bbd40-6aec-4757-a97c-a844b68e38cf" label="lyrics-like">in lóco ú- be-ri.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>